          "instructionEn": "Correct the mistakes, as in the example.",
          "instructionUz": "Xatolarni toping va to'g'rilang.",
          "explanationUz": "Bu mashq ENG FOYDALI turlardan biri: xatoni ko'rish — uni qilmaslikning\neng yaxshi yo'li.\n\nUnit 1–2 dagi 6 ta asosiy xato turi:\n  1) have/has aralashtirish  (he HAVE got → he HAS got)\n  2) be/have got aralashtirish (Where HAS he from → Where IS he from)\n  3) is/are mos kelmasligi   (The Pyramids IS → ARE)\n  4) a/an noto'g'ri          (a actor → AN actor)\n  5) can dan keyin -s        (can playS → can PLAY)\n  6) qisqa javob noto'g'ri   (No, I can → No, I CAN'T)",
          "items": [
            {
              "n": 1,
              "textEn": "He have got a beard.",
              "answer": "has",
              "given": true,
              "whyUz": "he → HAS got"
            },
            {
              "n": 2,
              "textEn": "They hasn't got a car.",
              "answer": "haven't",
              "whyUz": "they → HAVEN'T got"
            },
            {
              "n": 3,
              "textEn": "Where has Fergus from?",
              "answer": "is",
              "whyUz": "Joy so'ralganda 'be' ishlatiladi: 'Where IS he from?'"
            },
            {
