          "type": "dialogue_fill",
          "instructionEn": "Fill in you, he, she, it, they, as in the example.",
          "instructionUz": "you, he, she, it, they dan mosini qo'ying.",
          "explanationUz": "JAVOB olmoshni aytib beradi:\n  'My sister, Sarah'  → ayol  → she\n  'My uncle, Bob'     → erkak → he\n  'Steve and Mary'    → ikki kishi → they\n  'A letter'          → narsa → it\n  'we're from England' → savol 'you' haqida bo'lgan\n\nDIQQAT: 'Who is she?' — odam haqida. 'What is it?' — narsa haqida.\nOdam uchun WHO, narsa uchun WHAT.",
          "items": [
            {
              "n": 1,
              "lines": [
                {
                  "who": "A",
                  "textEn": "Who are ___ ?",
                  "answer": "you",
                  "given": true
